OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1788251146
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHow catastrophic flash flood unfolded
OL,4,Aat remote Nepal-China border point
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat happened in the minutes that
OL,7,Ffollowed is still difficult to
OL,8,Freconstruct. But fragments of video and
OL,9,Fsatellite imagery from before and after
OL,10,Fthe disaster have begun to reveal the
OL,11,Fscale of the destruction. Much of the
OL,12,Fborder complex appears to have been
OL,13,Fswept away, with buildings that once
OL,14,Fcrowded the valley floor simply gone.
OL,16,FGyirong was one of the places
OL,17,Fdevastated by the floods that tore
OL,18,Fthrough the region on 26 August.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
