OL,3,AEx-gang boss guilty of orchestrating
OL,4,A1996 murder of rapper Tupac Shakur
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer gang boss Duane "Keffe D" Davis
OL,7,Fhas been found guilty of orchestrating
OL,8,Fthe murder of Tupac Shakur - the first
OL,9,Fconviction in a cold case that has
OL,10,Fintrigued hip-hop fans for nearly 30
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FThe jury found him guilty of one count
OL,14,Fof murder with a deadly weapon for the
OL,15,Frap superstar's death in a drive-by
OL,16,Fshooting in Las Vegas on 7 September
OL,17,F1996.
OL,19,FDressed in a black suit, the
OL,20,F63-year-old stood impassively in the
OL,21,FLas Vegas court as the verdict was
OL,22,Fread, before saying he would appeal.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
